  "bodyHash": "f58f114a4dfde06f",
  "content": "<p>此模組為村民新增了<em><strong>怪物獵人職業</strong></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p>怪物獵人擁有許多有趣的<strong>與生物掉落物相關的貿易</strong></p>\n<p>他還使用了一個新的<strong>工作檯「獵人桌」</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em><strong>目前的特殊貿易項目：</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>黏性陷阱</strong></p>\n<p>-作為蜘蛛網的替代品，可投擲且更耐用</p>\n<p>-會像蜘蛛網一樣減緩敵人速度</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>鋒利陷阱</strong></p>\n<p>-一種可投擲的陷阱，會對生物造成傷害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱原型</strong></p>\n<p>-可用於在獵人工作台製作陷阱</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>獵人之刀</strong></p>\n<p>-每次命中都會造成半顆心的額外傷害，加上生物最大生命值1-6%的傷害；如果目標被困在陷阱中，則會造成兩顆心的額外傷害，加上生物最大生命值5-8%的傷害。它還會施加持續2秒的緩慢I效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>其他特殊物品：</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>靈魂鏈陷阱</strong></p>\n<p>-一種可投擲的陷阱，會將生物拉向它</p>\n<p>-會像蜘蛛網一樣減緩敵人速度</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>此模組是使用MCreator製作的</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmonster-hunter-villager\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth頁面</a></em></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em><strong>查看我的其他模組：</strong></em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dark-side-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/919/93/638380942855441364.jpeg\" alt=\"Dark Side\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monstrous-slimes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/930/440/638403264768147418.png\" alt=\"Monstrous Slimes\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yoshis-random-things\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/919/475/638381729117633371.jpeg\" alt=\"Yoshi's Random Things\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cataclysmic-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/888/526/638327113429388003.png\" alt=\"Cataclysmic Creeper\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paper-and-cardboard\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/928/638322024567415536.png\" alt=\"Paper and Cardboard\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-falling\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/907/264/638358230142431941.png\" alt=\"Better Falling\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dont-void-arrows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/888/583/638327202335050766.png\" alt=\"Don't void Arrows\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/barely-simple-staffs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/970/993/638472488188954369.png\" alt=\"Barely Simple Staffs\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyfall-meteorites\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1000/129/256/256/638519030541684849_animated.gif\" alt=\"Skyfall: Meteorites\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quickshot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1080/153/256/256/638619438455340246_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glimmering-gardens\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1110/965/256/256/638662405266959303_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></strong></em></p>",
